                        "form": "derelictions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91d58309-3f00-3117-8582-afd354a2c333",
                        "entry_id": "b278cf73-8544-3c0d-b9b9-bac8a5ac126c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "玩忽职守，渎职"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aaed2f70-ec61-4e52-a74a-65904b9b06e7",
                                "sense_id": "91d58309-3f00-3117-8582-afd354a2c333",
                                "text": "The new soldier did not clean his cabin and was scolded for dereliction and disobedience.",
                                "translation": "新兵没有清理自己的隔间，被骂渎职，违抗命令。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8a1552e-d782-4235-a5a5-edbe6512ab96",
                                "sense_id": "91d58309-3f00-3117-8582-afd354a2c333",
                                "text": "What he did was a terrible dereliction of duty.",
                                "translation": "他犯了很严重的玩忽职守。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ac70d9e-8c25-457f-94ab-5c3a7103a24e",
                                "sense_id": "91d58309-3f00-3117-8582-afd354a2c333",
                                "text": "And his final act—leaving the Watch to accompany Tormund and the Wildlings back into the woods North of the wall—no longer seems like a dereliction of duty. It’s the recovery of duty, found by a man who feels he betrayed his queen, who thinks there’s no longer a place for him in these lands."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed91b899-a6a0-3d75-abbb-f7b8b875ebfa",
                        "entry_id": "b278cf73-8544-3c0d-b9b9-bac8a5ac126c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "遗弃，抛弃，荒废，破败"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "275faccb-8c29-4cca-b34a-2423d4592ec6",
                                "sense_id": "ed91b899-a6a0-3d75-abbb-f7b8b875ebfa",
                                "text": "After years of unsympathetic commercial use and dereliction, nothing of note remained inside, which accordingly has been reconfigured with modern amenities such as underfloor heating."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba4b57bf-cc63-33f9-af30-fdfb9298ef8f",
                        "entry_id": "b278cf73-8544-3c0d-b9b9-bac8a5ac126c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "因水路改变而显现的陆地"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ]
